---
import Policy from '../layouts/Policy.astro';
import { formatAddressLines, product, site } from '../site.config';
---

<Policy
  title="Warranty & returns"
  description="The Fox Fobz warranty, how to return a kit, and where to send it."
>
  <h2>Warranty</h2>
  <p>
    Fox Fobz kits carry a {product.warrantyLength} limited warranty against defects in materials and workmanship, starting
    on the date your order is delivered. If a part fails under normal use, we’ll repair or replace it.
  </p>
  <p>The warranty doesn’t cover:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Damage from incorrect installation, wiring changes, or modifications to the kit</li>
    <li>Water, impact, or electrical damage, including from other faults in the vehicle</li>
    <li>Normal wear, including fob batteries and cosmetic wear</li>
    <li>The vehicle’s own door lock actuators, wiring, or other factory parts</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Returns</h2>
  <p>
    You can return an unused kit in its original packaging within {product.returnWindowDays} days of delivery for a refund
    of the product price. Kits that have been installed can be returned only under the warranty above.
  </p>

  <h2>How to return</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      Email <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a> with your name, order email, and the reason for
      the return.
    </li>
    <li>Pack the kit securely, with a note that includes your name and order email.</li>
    <li>
      Ship it to our PO box <strong>by USPS only</strong>. UPS, FedEx and other carriers can’t deliver to a PO box, and
      those packages will be returned to you.
    </li>
  </ol>
  <address>
    {formatAddressLines().map((line) => <>{line}<br /></>)}
  </address>
  <p>
    We recommend a USPS service with tracking. Return shipping is your cost unless the kit arrived defective or we sent
    the wrong item, in which case we’ll reimburse your USPS postage.
  </p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>
    Once the kit arrives and we’ve checked it, we refund your original payment method, usually within 5 business days.
    Your bank may take a few more days to show it. Original shipping charges aren’t refundable unless the return is
    because of our error.
  </p>
</Policy>
